{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Asteroid Blues\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"1998-11-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Faye teams up with Spike and Jet to track down a gang of space activists that plans on turning the human population into monkeys!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76885/219123.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"アステロイド・ブルース\"},{\"title\":\"Stray Dog Strut\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"1998-04-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"A night at the casino lands Spike and Jet in hot water when they cross paths with Faye Valentine, a stunning con artist wanted by the law – and the bad guys.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76885/219122.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"野良犬のストラット\"},{\"title\":\"Honky Tonk Women\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"1998-04-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Bebop crew pursues a renegade explosives expert, and Spike crosses paths with a nameless space trucker that hates bounty hunters.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76885/219126.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ホンキィ・トンク・ウィメン\"},{\"title\":\"Gateway Shuffle\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"1998-11-14\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Faye teams up with Spike and Jet to track down a gang of space activists that plans on turning the human population into monkeys!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/229112/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ゲイトウェイ・シャッフル\"},{\"title\":\"Ballad of Fallen Angels\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"1998-11-21\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Spike aims to collect the bounty on a member of the Red Dragon Syndicate, but his mission leads him into a deadly showdown with a face from his past!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228991/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"堕天使たちのバラッド\"},{\"title\":\"Sympathy for the Devil\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"1998-11-28\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The latest case for the crew of the Bebop finds Spike pitted against a young boy with a talent for the harmonica – and murder.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228979/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"悪魔を憐れむ歌\"},{\"title\":\"Heavy Metal Queen\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"1998-05-15\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When an unusual, blob-like space creature infects Ein, Faye, and Jet, Spike and Radical Edward must figure out a way to save their friends.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76885/219130.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ヘヴィ・メタル・クイーン\"},{\"title\":\"Waltz for Venus\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"1998-05-22\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Faye robs and abandons the Bebop crew, Spike goes in search of a woman he once knew, and Vicious makes another deadly appearance.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76885/219131.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ワルツ・フォー・ヴィーナス\"},{\"title\":\"Jamming with Edward\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"1998-05-29\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jet continues his mission to reunite his Bebop comrades, and Spike finds himself locked in a brutal dogfight with his old nemesis Vicious.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76885/219132.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ジャミング・ウィズ・エドワード\"},{\"title\":\"Ganymede Elegy\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"1998-06-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Bebop Crew embarks on a wild goose chase of a bounty hunt that leads them deep into space in search of an ancient chess master.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76885/300636.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ガニメデ慕情\"},{\"title\":\"Toys in the Attic\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"1998-06-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Jet brings in a fugitive from Faye’s past, the rebellious beauty must decide whether to turn him in – or give an old flame one last chance.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76885/300637.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"闇夜のヘヴィ・ロック\"},{\"title\":\"Jupiter Jazz (Part I)\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"1998-06-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When a mysterious package arrives, Faye disappears on a gambling binge, and Spike and Jet embark on a frustrating search for ancient technology!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76885/300640.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ジュピター・ジャズ (前編)\"},{\"title\":\"Jupiter Jazz (Part II)\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"1998-04-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Spike and Jet head to Tijuana to track down an outlaw smuggling a dangerous drug known as blood-eye. Jet wants the bounty, but Spike has eyes for a far prettier prize.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/76885/219120.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ジュピター・ジャズ (後編)\"},{\"title\":\"Bohemian Rhapsody\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"1998-06-05\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"The Bebop Crew embarks on a wild goose chase of a bounty hunt that leads them deep into space in search of an ancient chess master.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228990/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ボヘミアン・ラプソディー\"},{\"title\":\"My Funny Valentine\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"1998-06-12\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When Jet brings in a fugitive from Faye’s past, the rebellious beauty must decide whether to turn him in – or give an old flame one last chance.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228993/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"マイ・ファニー・ヴァレンタイン\"},{\"title\":\"Black Dog Serenade\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"1999-02-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Jet teams up with a former partner to settle the score with the man who took his arm, but he soon discovers that memories can be deceiving.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228984/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ブラック・ドッグ・セレナーデ\"},{\"title\":\"Mushroom Samba\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"1999-02-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"After the Bebop crash lands, Ed and Ein’s search for food turns up some very expensive mushrooms with psychedelic side effects!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228980/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"マッシュルーム・サンバ\"},{\"title\":\"Speak Like a Child\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"1998-06-19\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"When a mysterious package arrives, Faye disappears on a gambling binge, and Spike and Jet embark on a frustrating search for ancient technology!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228998/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"スピーク・ライク・ア・チャイルド\"},{\"title\":\"Wild Horses\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"1999-03-06\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"While Spike pays a visit to the man who built his ship, Faye and Jet go fishing for space pirates.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228987/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ワイルド・ホーセス\"},{\"title\":\"Pierrot Le Fou\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"1999-03-13\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Spike takes a beating during a chance encounter with an indestructible assassin. While Jet searches for the secret to the madman’s power, Spike goes looking for payback!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228986/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"道化師の鎮魂歌\"},{\"title\":\"Boogie Woogie Feng Shui\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"1999-03-20\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Spurred by a cryptic email, Jet goes looking for an old friend, but finds his daughter – and a mysterious sun stone – instead.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228985/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ブギ・ウギ・フンシェイ\"},{\"title\":\"Cowboy Funk\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"1999-03-27\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Spike’s attempts to apprehend the infamous Teddy Bear Bomber are maddeningly derailed by a mysterious – and clueless – cowboy!\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228997/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"カウボーイ・ファンク\"},{\"title\":\"Brain Scratch\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"1999-04-03\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Faye goes undercover to collect the bounty on a deranged cult leader, but when the mysterious organization brainwashes her into a very deep sleep – she’ll need a little help from her friends.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228999/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ブレイン・スクラッチ\"},{\"title\":\"Hard Luck Woman\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"1999-04-10\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Faye and Ed discover clues to their respective pasts that could send the crew of the Bebop heading in very different directions.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228988/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ハード・ラック・ウーマン\"},{\"title\":\"The Real Folk Blues (Part I)\",\"number\":25,\"airDate\":\"1999-04-17\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Spike and Jet are ambushed by members of the syndicate, and Faye has an unexpected encounter with a woman from Spike’s past.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/228982/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ザ・リアル・フォークブルース (前編)\"},{\"title\":\"The Real Folk Blues (Part II)\",\"number\":26,\"airDate\":\"1999-04-24\",\"duration\":25,\"synopsis\":\"Spike finally finds the woman he’s been searching for, and Faye makes a surprising return to the Bebop. With the syndicate in hot pursuit, Spike seeks to end the reign of Vicious.\\nSource: crunchyroll\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/229001/original.jpeg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ザ・リアル・フォークブルース (後編)\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":[]}